1
00:00:00,751 --> 00:00:02,181
(Howard:)until I found
his Twitter handle.

2
00:00:02,186 --> 00:00:04,456
(Raj:)From there, it was easy to find
him on Instagram, Snapchat

3
00:00:04,455 --> 00:00:05,985
(Raj:)and pretty much track
his every movement.

4
00:00:05,990 --> 00:00:09,060
(Howard:)So if you think that's creepy,
you married the wrong guy.

5
00:00:09,894 --> 00:00:11,894
(Bernadette:)Maybe I should marry Trent.

6
00:00:11,896 --> 00:00:15,096
(Raj:)Yeah, like she
could get Trent.

7
00:00:15,099 --> 00:00:16,769
(laughing)

8
00:00:17,935 --> 00:00:19,305
(Dave:)This is delicious.

9
00:00:19,303 --> 00:00:20,533
(Leonard:)Thank you.

10
00:00:20,538 --> 00:00:23,138
(Dave:)Been a long time since
I had a home-cooked meal.

11
00:00:23,141 --> 00:00:25,341
(Amy:)When you were married,
did your wife cook?

12
00:00:25,343 --> 00:00:27,013
(Dave:)Not at first, no.

13
00:00:27,011 --> 00:00:29,611
(Dave:)But when she began cheating
on me with a French chef,

14
00:00:29,614 --> 00:00:31,914
(Dave:)she became quite the wiz
in t kitchen.

15
00:00:31,916 --> 00:00:33,486
(Amy:)So, a little silver lining.

16
00:00:33,484 --> 00:00:34,854
(Dave:)I suppose.

17
00:00:34,852 --> 00:00:37,852
(Dave:)Yeah. Nothing takes the sting
out of a shattered life

18
00:00:37,855 --> 00:00:41,355
(Dave:)like a properly-seasoned
bowl of onion soup.

19
00:00:41,359 --> 00:00:43,989
(Dave:)How long have you,
uh, lived here?

20
00:00:43,995 --> 00:00:45,995
(Amy:)About five years.

21
00:00:45,997 --> 00:00:48,297
(Amy:)I'm actually thinking
of moving to a better place

22
00:00:48,299 --> 00:00:50,669
(Amy:)now that I don't need
to be so close to...

23
00:00:50,668 --> 00:00:52,168
(Amy:)Well, you know.

24
00:00:52,170 --> 00:00:54,070
(Dave:)I do. The brilliant physicist

25
00:00:54,071 --> 00:00:57,341
(Dave:)that I now know lives
in the area, not that I care.

26
00:00:57,341 --> 00:00:59,971
(Amy:)Yeah. Anyway, he doesn't drive,

27
00:00:59,977 --> 00:01:02,477
(Amy:)so, I pretty much had
to take him everywhere.

